From 4f8a39b2f40c0a782da6968ec14f4564d798808e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 10:33:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add English / Traditional Chinese language switcher

Two flag buttons (EN, zh-TW) with aria-pressed and aria-labels. All UI text,
placeholders, titles and status/error messages come from a translations
dictionary (data-i18n attributes plus t() in app.js). Default language comes
from localStorage, then navigator.language (zh-* -> zh-TW); the choice is
persisted and <html lang> is updated. KML output and API-supplied names stay
untranslated. CJK uses system font stacks only; CSP unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mg5ofqx5KjHLota3gMx2dG
